---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../components/container.astro";
---

<Layout title="About CareBridge Health | Safety First Medical Tourism">
  <Container>
    <div class="mt-16 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">We Don't Own Hospitals.<br>We Audit Them.</h1>
      <p class="text-xl mt-4 text-slate-600">
        CareBridge Health is not a hospital. We are a patient safety advocate that helps international patients navigate India's medical system without getting ripped off.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
      <div>
         <img 
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551076805-e1869033e561?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop" 
          alt="CareBridge Team auditing a clinic" 
          class="rounded-lg shadow-xl"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">The 80% Rejection Rule</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">
          India has over 5,000 hair and dental clinics. <strong>Most are unsafe.</strong>
          They reuse needles, hire unqualified technicians, and hide hidden costs.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-6">
          At CareBridge, we physically inspect our partner clinics. We check their sterilization logs, their surgeon's certifications, and their pricing. 
          <strong>We reject 80% of the clinics that apply to work with us.</strong>
        </p>
        <p class="font-bold text-slate-900">If we wouldn't send our own family there, we won't send you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 mb-20">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12">Our Promise to You</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. No Hidden Costs</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600">The price we quote on WhatsApp is the final price. No "surprise" taxes or fees when you land in India.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Direct Access</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600">You speak directly to the lead surgeon before booking your flight. No middlemen blocking the doctor.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. VIP Logistics</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600">From the moment you land at the airport, our team handles your SIM card, hotel check-in, and transport.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</Layout>